OL,3,GNEWSAGrangemouth firm took #1m of
OL,4,Apublic money months before closure
OL,5,Aannouncement
OL,6,
OL,7,FA chemical firm collected #1m of
OL,8,FScottish Enterprise funding to create
OL,9,Fnew jobs - just months before
OL,10,Fannouncing plans to close its
OL,11,FGrangemouth site.
OL,13,FThe cash was part of #2.2m awarded to
OL,14,FSyngenta in May last year to expand
OL,15,Fproduction at the plant.
OL,17,FUnion leaders are meeting with the UK
OL,18,Fand Scottish governments after nearly
OL,19,F400 jobs have been put at risk.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
